{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在少数短屏段（尤其S01、S05）感受词堆得偏密，个别意象跳跃较远，容易让观众来不及消化；Y的整句叙述更自然顺口。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】突出叙事锚点，感受字缩小并随音乐段落出现，观众可以先抓住人物念头，再接收音乐中的细节，不必同时处理所有信息。更重要的是，X把怕给对方负担、因对方没有退开而放松、越亲近越怕失去、最终不再隐藏喜欢的心理变化串成了完整因果链，同时通过水面、小船、摇荡和失去支撑等反复出现的意象维持前后联系。Y的句子更流畅，但部分细腻的心理变化和音乐层次被概括成了比较泛的情绪描述。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8401ef17-32a5-4689-b749-075da9eb9fb3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T011046563555Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.14, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:11:52.711911+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b14bd15cd3bed8e385867487e6afdbd39b76922129fa608b18c3aa099fa69d4e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\cha